# The resource scripts are UTF-16LE with a BOM, and any line-ending
# normalisation corrupts them, so they are binary as far as git is concerned.
# Git already infers this from the NUL bytes; saying it means a later
# `* text=auto` cannot quietly undo it. Localization/strings.rc is generated by
# Localization/build.ps1 in the same encoding.
Src/let-it-rain/*.rc binary
Src/let-it-rain/Localization/*.rc binary
